    <step order="1">Seam tests per the closed set below.</step>
    <step order="2">Write the attestation architecture section (event log, replay, versioning policy, coverage boundary, no-materialization rationale citing 06 §F4, known gaps).</step>
    <step order="3">Full suite green in CI; update TASK-INDEX.md.</step>
